## 4. Ingress API Specifications (OpenAPI 3.1 & RPC)

### Route: `POST /api/v1/auth/login`
- **Purpose:** Primary ingress authentication endpoint.
- **Headers:**
  - `Content-Type: application/json`
  - `X-Forwarded-For: <client-ip>` (required for rate limiting)
- **Request Body Schema (JSON Schema):**
\`\`\`json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["username", "password"],
  "properties": {
    "username": { "type": "string", "minLength": 3, "maxLength": 100 },
    "password": { "type": "string", "minLength": 8, "maxLength": 128 },
    "rememberMe": { "type": "boolean", "default": false },
    "returnUrl": { "type": "string", "format": "uri-reference" }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
\`\`\`
- **Responses:**
  - `200 OK`: Successful authentication. Emits `Set-Cookie: session_token=...; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict`. Body: `{ "status": "SUCCESS", "userId": "uuid" }`
  - `202 Accepted`: MFA verification required. Returns `{ "status": "MFA_REQUIRED", "mfaToken": "jwt", "channels": ["SMS", "TOTP"] }`
  - `400 Bad Request`: Validation failure on input shape (`RFC 7807 Problem Details`).
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid credentials. Returns `{ "error": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS", "remainingAttempts": 2 }`
  - `423 Locked`: Account is locked. Returns `{ "error": "ACCOUNT_LOCKED", "retryAfterSeconds": 900 }`
  - `429 Too Many Requests`: IP rate limit exceeded. Header: `Retry-After: 60`.

